SUMMARY:Halloween
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:Halloween falls on October 31 and is\, by most measures\, the m
 ost widely observed non-federal holiday in the United States. It is also o
 ne of the least historically tidy: what Americans do on October 31 is a co
